https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

It covers:
- the scripts (videos/scripts/*.md) and the Masterclass plan (videos/MASTERCLASS_PLAN.md);
- the narration, viewer texts and editorial metadata of the manifests and the
  catalogue (videos/manifests/*.json, videos/catalog.json);
- the rendered videos, captions and transcripts published on
  https://medias.benevol.app (MP4, VTT, TXT).

Attribution: « Benevol (benevol.app), CC BY-SA 4.0 », with a link to
https://www.benevol.app/videos or to the video used.

Not covered:
- the name « Benevol » and its logo, which are not licensed for reuse;
- the generation tools (videos/tools, videos/lib) and the rest of the
  repository, which are free software under the GNU AGPL v3 (see the LICENSE
  file at the root of the repository);
- the demonstration data shown in the videos is fictional (example.org).

The narration voice is generated with Google's Gemini text-to-speech; Google's
Gemini API terms state that Google does not claim ownership of generated content.
